I just started out a new tourist character (part of my ongoing
quest to ascend with one).  In the very first room was an altar
and a grey stone.  I kicked the grey stone and it flew across
the room.  I looked in my inventory, and one of my potions of
extra healing was blessed.  The altar was co-aligned.

Clearly, when the game taunts me by starting me off this well,
it has a nasty death planned for me soon.  Any bets?
